    titleEmphasis="Nineteen, Grouped and Judged"
    standfirst="Barcelona has more plausible attractions than any visit can hold, and they are spread across four grounds that do not touch. So these nineteen are grouped by what each one contributes and judged on the only question that matters — whether it is worth the part of the city you must give up for it."
    stats={[
      { num: '19', label: 'Entries' },
