        the thing it takes you to. Everything else is called free, ticketed or
        expensive, with a link to the official page, because a stale figure is worse
        than none. The figures that do appear were checked against official sources
        on <strong>4 August 2026</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        On evidence: everything below was visited except where the entry says
        otherwise, across two August stays in <strong>2023</strong> and
        <strong>2024</strong>, the second of them six nights in El Raval. Two
        entries are marked <em>assessed</em> and are argued from official information
        and geography rather than memory. No opening hour or price here is a
        recollection; those change, and they are research.
      </p>
